    "detailed_description": "You wake up in an icy land surrounded by a vast and endless ocean, you don't know who you are and why you are here...<br>Seeking to know the truth, and escape a dark evil that lurks behind you, you will have to move forward to the truth that you are desperately trying to find.<br>Are you condemned to stay in this icy prison for ever?<br><br>Or will you give in to the temptation to see what is hiding in the depths of the well?<br>Explore the ice lands, avoid the traps that are set for you!<br><br>Run and never look back, learn the history of your own past, and break the chains of your imprisonment.<br><br>Choose your path and push back the shadow that threatens you once and for all.<br>In the well...<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rpg 2D</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Duration of the game (1h-2h)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Basic retro graphic style</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Save not allowed</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple choices</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> riddles to solve</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique and fascinating story</li></ul>",
